    "turn_idx": 8,
    "turn_text": "When I think of Kamala Harris, I don't necessarily think far left. I mean, she talked about being a prosecutor. She was measured on her Israel Gaza positions. Her position on the border got more moderate. So far left does not necessarily, to me, describe what happened in the last election.",
