    "turn_idx": 9,
    "turn_text": "I am not suggesting that Kamala Harris is far left, right? So I'll take as an example, defund the police. It was never the case that the majority of the Democratic Party endorsed defund the police, but the far left has an outsized microphone and therefore has an outsized impact in defining the image of the Democratic Party in the public mind.",
