    "turn_idx": 10,
    "turn_text": "And you don't think that's because the far left is exaggerated by the right. I mean, that the right has a megaphone making it seem like the far left is the Democratic Party when neither Kamala Harris nor Joe Biden are especially far left or advocate for left policies.",
