    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/0/70759.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 49,
    "turn_text": "I'm shocked but not surprised. I find Donald Trump's victory to be shocking but not surprising because in recent electoral history, there is no precedent for an incumbent party winning a presidential election when more than 70% of Americans think the country is on the wrong track or headed in the wrong direction. And so in the end, it is not surprising that Trump fatigue was outweighed by the popular discontent over inflation and immigration.",
